
About the project

Where di sits in the architecture

di (wiring layer) — can import from everything
  ├── data       ✅  (DB_NAME, AppDatabase, UserDao, AuthRepositoryImpl)
  ├── domain     ✅  (AuthRepository, LoginUseCase, RegisterUseCase)
  └── presentation ✅ (EmailValidator, PasswordValidator)

///// Atomic Architecture /////


Basic Idea of Atomic Architecture

The UI is built like chemistry:

|── Atoms → Molecules → Organisms → Templates → Pages ──|

Each level combines smaller components.

ui/
 ├── atoms/
 │    ├── AppButton.kt
 │    ├── AppText.kt
 │
 ├── molecules/
 │    ├── SearchBar.kt
 │    ├── InputField.kt
 │
 ├── organisms/
 │    ├── ProductCard.kt
 │    ├── ProfileHeader.kt
 │
 ├── templates/
 │    ├── HomeTemplate.kt
 │
 └── pages/
      ├── HomeScreen.kt
      ├── ProfileScreen.kt


Effects :

Launched Effect : Runs when composable enters composition AND restarts when key changes

Side Effect : Runs after every recomposition to sync state with outside world

Disposable Effect : Starts when composable enters composition and disposes when it leaves or key changes

